---
layout: null
sitemap: false
---
{%- comment -%} Site search index, built from _data/search.yml plus the verified-list state pages and directories (_data/seo_landings.yml, written by scripts/build-seo-landings.mjs), the where-to-learn finders (_data/learn_index.yml, scripts/build-learn-finders.mjs), the Journey Blueprint pages not listed by hand (_data/in/journey_search.yml, scripts/build-journey-pages.mjs) and the USA college pages (_data/us/college_search.json, scripts/build-us-colleges.mjs). Fetched lazily by the header search (_includes/career-search.html).
One subject = one list (2026-11-01): an entry that opens the old coaching / college finder for a key a where-to-learn finder now owns (_data/learn_index.yml routes, e.g. "CA Coaching" → coaching.html?stream=commerce&exam=ca) is pointed straight at that finder's State box (learn/ca.html?pick=state), with or without the ?stream= part. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign search_items = site.data.search.items | concat: site.data.seo_landings.search | concat: site.data.learn_index.search | concat: site.data.in.journey_search.items | concat: site.data.us.college_search -%}
{%- capture search_json -%}{{ search_items | jsonify }}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- for kind in site.data.learn_index.routes -%}
  {%- if kind[0] == "colleges" -%}{%- assign sj_page = "colleges.html" -%}{%- assign sj_param = "course" -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign sj_page = "coaching.html" -%}{%- assign sj_param = "exam" -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- for r in kind[1] -%}
    {%- capture sj_to -%}"learn/{{ r[1].finder }}.html?{% if r[1].q != "" %}{{ r[1].q }}&pick=state{% else %}pick=state{% endif %}"{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture sj_from -%}"{{ sj_page }}?{{ sj_param }}={{ r[0] }}"{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- assign search_json = search_json | replace: sj_from, sj_to -%}
    {%- for st in site.data.explorer.streams -%}
      {%- capture sj_from -%}"{{ sj_page }}?stream={{ st.id }}&{{ sj_param }}={{ r[0] }}"{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- assign search_json = search_json | replace: sj_from, sj_to -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{{ search_json }}
